---
// The tea-and-cake running joke, straight from Chris's review replies.
---
<aside class="cuppa" aria-label="A note about tea">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 64 56" aria-hidden="true" class="cup">
    <path d="M10 22h34v12a14 14 0 0 1-14 14h-6a14 14 0 0 1-14-14Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <path d="M44 26h4a6 6 0 0 1 0 12h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/>
    <path d="M6 52h44" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M20 6c-3 4 3 6 0 11M28 4c-3 4 3 7 0 12M36 7c-3 4 3 6 0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" class="steam"/>
  </svg>
  <p>Our customers keep making us tea. We keep making their cars shine. <em>Fair trade.</em></p>
  <p class="small">“Also a BIG thank you for the best cuppa tea I’ve had in .... forever lol.” — Chris, replying to Tasha</p>
</aside>
<style>
  .cuppa {
    position: relative; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem 1.3rem; border: 1px solid #e3d8c3;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 30px -22px rgba(23, 24, 27, 0.5);
    transform: rotate(-1.4deg); max-width: 22rem;
  }
  .cuppa::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 50%; width: 72px; height: 20px; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(2deg);
    background: rgba(201, 162, 75, 0.45);
  }
  .cup { width: 48px; color: var(--oxide); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  p { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 500; }
  em { color: var(--oxide); }
  .small { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .steam { animation: steam 3.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
    @keyframes steam { from { opacity: 0.35; } to { opacity: 0.9; } }
  }
</style>
